{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast world, if a mortal being harbors a spiritual root, they may catch a glimpse into the mysteries of the cosmos, yet this is by no means an easy path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the Great Dao, all are but ants; cultivating immortality is to defy the natural order. One must take their own body as the foundation, absorb the spiritual energy of heaven and earth, seize the creation of the universe, seek all methods, nurture the fundamental origin, battle powerful foes, slay inner demons, and survive heavenly tribulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is long and arduous. Even through thousands of hardships and tribulations, one must uphold their original heart to hope for transcendence from the mortal world and achieve great freedom.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3001030?t=1749617350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001030/d6d545fa61f0fb17f17b0a42e63e0820ecd1cc3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749617350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001030/ef483d4ba02e18e1688421e0bdd334d8f5139799/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749617350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001030/ef483d4ba02e18e1688421e0bdd334d8f5139799/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749617350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This world is full of the survival of the fittest, and you may also be drawn into the dark side of the world."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast world, if a mortal being harbors a spiritual root, they may catch a glimpse into the mysteries of the cosmos, yet this is by no means an easy path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the Great Dao, all are but ants; cultivating immortality is 